{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1310588-flaws-advice-nsfw","id":1310588,"title":"Flaws advice (NSFW)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-05-07T11:32:32-07:00","id":1310588,"title":"<img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/icons/icon4.png\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" alt=\"\" /> Flaws advice (NSFW)","content":"Greetings,<br /> <br /> I apologise in advance if this is not something that should be asked here, but when I make characters (PCs or NPCs) I trying to give them full stats. I have a couple of characters with things that I know that should be flaws, but I don't know which ones: <ol class=\"decimal\"><li>Her father is a member of a proscribed organisation (not herself) if this is known, her safety will be at risk: whether she is used as a hostage, denied jobs, asked to quit current employment, might get killed, etc. Should the Flaw be <b>Family Issues</b> (if so, what level?), or <b>Dark Secret</b>?</li> <li>He likes to watch child porn, but has never engaged in it himself. He also hires prostitutes. Should it this be <b>Extreme Kink </b>(if so, what level?) or <b>Dark Secret</b>?</li> <li>She partially speaks a language, but the <b>Language </b>merit implies fluency what do I use? (Chronicles of Darkness has a <b>Multilingual </b>merit, is there something like this for Ascension?)</li> </ol><br /> I know this are sensitive topics, but only Mage has the rich list of flaws and merits that can cover characters and make them alive in my eyes.<br /> <br /> Thanks,","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4967,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","user":"lbeaumanior","date":". 05-07-2019, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-09T07:06:00-07:00","id":1310968,"title":"","content":"Extreme kink covers this stuff. It's an easy 5 pointer, since it's criminal. There's overlap with dark secret, but I wouldn't give both, as that'd be rewarding the character sheet twice for the exact same thing.<br /> <br /> Her father's association sounds more like a Dark Secret. It's the reveal that will be a problem.<br /> <br /> I don't think the language merits are granular enough for this kind of differentiation. Just give her the language and play it as janky. If it's so bad you need it to be significantly troublesome you can give it a 1 point of Cultural Other. People have trouble communicating with you and that generates misunderstandings.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse/visitormessage/1408635-visitor-message-from-synapse#post1408635\" target=\"_blank\">Check my Exalted homebrew</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/32-synapse","name":"Synapse","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar32_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1507"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-05-14T11:37:02-07:00","id":1312131,"title":"","content":"Thanks for the answers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4967-lbeaumanior","name":"lbeaumanior","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4967_2.png","title